OL,3,GNEWSA'The harder you work, the more you
OL,4,Alearn and earn'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBricklayer Ash Mahoney said he always
OL,7,Fknew what trade he would go into and
OL,8,Fnow running his own business, said it
OL,9,Fwas a great career choice with earnings
OL,10,Fof #300 a day "and more at times".
OL,12,FIt was rewarding work and "the harder
OL,13,Fyou work, the more you learn" and can
OL,14,Fearn, the Birmingham businessman said,
OL,15,Fadding he was confident that it was a
OL,16,Ftrade that would not be negatively
OL,17,Fimpacted by AI.
OL,19,FA new construction skills academy for
OL,20,Fthe region has been announced, to train
OL,21,Fthe estimated 3,810 new workers needed
OL,22,Feach year.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
